{"id":69011,"date":"2022-10-02T18:39:25","date_gmt":"2022-10-02T17:39:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69011"},"modified":"2026-09-30T15:53:44","modified_gmt":"2026-09-30T14:53:44","slug":"x-mas-night-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/x-mas-night-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"14\u00ba X-mas Night Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">14\u00ba X-mas Night Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>14\u00ba X-mas Night Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida agendada para as <strong>16:00<\/strong> no <strong>Soutocico<\/strong> e meta no centro de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Esta conceituada competi\u00e7\u00e3o noturna re\u00fane atletas e caminheiros num percurso desafiante e festivo que celebra o esp\u00edrito desportivo da \u00e9poca natal\u00edcia.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa oficial contempla as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>Trail Sprint (19 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail (12 km)<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong>, ligando o Soutocico ao emblem\u00e1tico Jardim Cam\u00f5es e Posto de Turismo em Leiria. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura postos de abastecimento, balne\u00e1rios no Est\u00e1dio Municipal de Leiria, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e medalha exclusiva a todos os finalistas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo dos <strong>Liz Runners \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desporto, Cultura e Recreio<\/strong>, em estreita colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Leiria, garantindo rigor log\u00edstico, seguran\u00e7a no percurso e um ambiente de grande confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FA